# Copy this file to .env (which is gitignored) and fill in your own values.
# main.py and news.py read it at start, so the launchd daily run sees it too.

# The SEC asks automated tools to identify themselves with a name and a contact email,
# like their sample "Sample Company Name AdminContact@<sample company domain>.com".
# Without this line the SEC feed is skipped (the Federal Reserve feed still runs).
# SEC_USER_AGENT="Your Name you@example.com"
